### ==================== EMPLOYEE ENDPOINTS ====================

### Create Employee (Admin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tran Thi B",
  "email": "tranthib@company.com",
  "phone": "0912345678",
  "role": "ADMIN",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Create Employee (Staff)
POST {{baseUrl}}/employees
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Pham Van C",
  "email": "phamvanc@company.com",
  "phone": "0912345679",
  "role": "STAFF",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Get All Employees
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees

### Get Employee by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/employees/1

### Update Employee
PUT {{baseUrl}}/employees/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tran Thi B Updated",
  "email": "tranthib.updated@company.com",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### Delete Employee
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/employees/1

