### ==================== PROMOTION ENDPOINTS ====================

### Create Promotion (Discount Percent)
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SUMMER2026",
  "description": "Summer sale - 20% off",
  "discountPercent": 20.0,
  "discountAmount": 0.0,
  "usageLimit": 100,
  "usedCount": 0,
  "startDate": "2026-06-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-08-31T23:59:59",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Create Promotion (Discount Amount)
POST {{baseUrl}}/promotions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "FLAT50",
  "description": "Flat 50 discount",
  "discountPercent": 0.0,
  "discountAmount": 50.0,
  "usageLimit": 50,
  "usedCount": 0,
  "startDate": "2026-06-01T00:00:00",
  "endDate": "2026-12-31T23:59:59",
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### Get All Promotions
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotions

### Get Promotion by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/promotions/1

### Update Promotion
PUT {{baseUrl}}/promotions/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "SUMMER2026UPDATED",
  "status": "INACTIVE"
}

### Delete Promotion
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/promotions/1

