### ==================== INVOICE ENDPOINTS ====================

### Create Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-001",
  "createdAt": "2026-06-05T11:00:00",
  "subtotal": 2000.00,
  "discountAmount": 100.00,
  "totalAmount": 1900.00,
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "customer": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "employee": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### Get All Invoices
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices

### Get Invoice by ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1

### Update Invoice Status
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "paymentMethod": "BANK_TRANSFER"
}

### Suspend Invoice (Treo don)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "SUSPENDED"
}

### Cancel Invoice (Huy don)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "CANCELLED"
}

### Delete Invoice
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1

---

