### ==================== SAMPLE WORKFLOW: COMPLETE SALES TRANSACTION ====================

### Step 1: Create Customer
POST {{baseUrl}}/customers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "John Doe",
  "phone": "0975555555",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "address": "789 Elm Street, Hanoi",
  "membershipTier": "Silver",
  "points": 0.0,
  "totalSpent": 0.0
}

### Step 2: Create Invoice
POST {{baseUrl}}/invoices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "invoiceNumber": "INV-20260605-001",
  "createdAt": "2026-06-05T14:30:00",
  "subtotal": 3999.98,
  "discountAmount": 400.00,
  "totalAmount": 3599.98,
  "paymentMethod": "CASH",
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "customer": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "employee": {
    "id": 2
  }
}

### Step 3: Apply Promotion (Update Invoice with discount)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "discountAmount": 500.00,
  "totalAmount": 3499.98
}

### Step 4: Complete Payment
PUT {{baseUrl}}/invoices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED",
  "paymentMethod": "CASH"
}

---

### ==================== SAMPLE WORKFLOW: IMPORT WAREHOUSE ====================

### Step 1: Create Supplier
POST {{baseUrl}}/suppliers
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Tech Wholesale Co",
  "contactPerson": "Le Van F",
  "phone": "0343334445",
  "email": "sales@techwholesale.com",
  "address": "789 Industrial Zone, Hanoi",
  "bankAccount": "1111222233334444"
}

### Step 2: Create Import Warehouse
POST {{baseUrl}}/import-warehouses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "importNumber": "IMP-20260605-001",
  "createdAt": "2026-06-05T09:00:00",
  "totalAmount": 25000.00,
  "status": "PENDING",
  "supplier": {
    "id": 1
  },
  "employee": {
    "id": 1
  }
}

### Step 3: Complete Import
PUT {{baseUrl}}/import-warehouses/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "COMPLETED"
}

---

### ==================== INSTRUCTIONS ====================
###
### How to use this file:
###
### 1. Install REST Client extension in VS Code
###    - Go to Extensions (Ctrl+Shift+X)
###    - Search for "REST Client"
###    - Install by Huachao Mao
###
### 2. Open this file in VS Code
###
### 3. Click "Send Request" above any request to test it
###
### 4. Response will appear in a new tab
###
### 5. Change IDs (1, 2, etc.) as needed based on your data
###
### Notes:
### - Make sure your Spring Boot application is running on port 8081
### - Create a Product first, then reference it in Invoice Details
### - Create a Customer before creating an Invoice
### - Create a Supplier before creating an Import Warehouse
### - Status values: ACTIVE, INACTIVE, COMPLETED, PENDING, CANCELLED, SUSPENDED
### - Payment Methods: CASH, BANK_TRANSFER
### - Employee Roles: ADMIN, STAFF
### - Membership Tiers: Bronze, Silver, Gold, Platinum
